{
    "title": "GO / Taxi app for Japan",
    "description": "\u30fbGO is most used Taxi App(Taxi booking app) in Japan\r\nGO is the No. 1* Taxi App(cab app) serving 45 of Japan's 47 prefectures, including major tourist areas like Hokkaido, Tokyo, Kyoto, Osaka, Fukuoka and Okinawa.\r\n80% of time spent on Taxi Apps in Japan is on GO.\r\nYou can now sign up with a non-Japanese mobile number.\r\n\r\n* Sourced from data.ai by Sensor Tower\r\n- Number of Taxi App(cab app) downloads in Japan(Total of app Store and Google Play)\r\n- Survey period: October 1, 2020 - Jun 30, 2024\r\n- Among the top 5 Taxi Apps in Japan, GO has an 80% market share of total usage time.\uff08Total of iOS and Android smartphone\uff09\r\n- Survey period: January 1, 2021 - May 31, 2024\r\n*Actual app screen may differ.\r\n\r\n\u30fbTravel around Japan easily with GO\r\nUse GO to hail the nearest Taxi(cab) to get to your destination easily. No more having to stand on the side of the road waiting for one to go by!\r\n- Go easy anywhere on time\r\n- Stress-free Taxi(cab) experience\r\n\"- Best Taxi(cab) type selection\r\n*Messaging and Calling features available to contact the driver directly.\"\r\n\r\n\u30fbFrom hail to payment in one app by using GO\r\nDo everything from hailing a Taxi(cab), to confirming your ride and paying your fare in the GO app, and go easy anywhere in Japan.\r\n\r\n\u30fbGO PREMIUM: Request a large luxury van\r\nWith the GO app you can easily request a professional, highly-rated driver to pick you up in a luxury van with seating for up to six. This service is currently available in the following 15 wards of Tokyo: Chiyoda, Chuo, Minato, Shinjuku, Bunkyo, Taito, Sumida, Koto, Shinagawa, Meguro, Ota, Setagaya, Shibuya, Nakano and Toshima wards\r\n*Not available in portions of Taito, Sumida, Koto, Shinagawa, Ota, Setagaya, Nakano and Toshima wards.\r\nVisit the webpage below for details.\r\nhttps://go.goinc.jp/en/premium\r\n\r\n\u30fbReservation Service: Reserve a Taxi for a specific date and time\r\nOur Reservation Service automatically hails a Taxi for you on the date and time you specify. Reservations can be made from 15 minutes to 7 days in advance.\r\nA service charge will apply in addition to the Taxi fare at the time of payment.\r\n*While limited to certain urban areas, new areas being added all the time.\r\n\r\n\u30fbAirport Flat-rate\r\nGet flat-rate fares from a location you specify, such as your home, hotel, a train station or travel destination to select airports. With GO there is no need to make reservations in advance: you can take advantage of this flat-rate even if you want to hail a Taxi right away.\r\nCurrently available for: boarding from Tokyo - Haneda/ Narita Airport (Tokyo - Narita is only transfer to the airport).\r\n\r\n\u30fbPay your fare cashlessly with GO Pay while you ride\r\nPay for your fare automatically by adding your credit card in the app and choosing GO Pay in the Taxi. When you arrive at your destination just get out.\r\nNo more time wasted dealing with change or credit cards.\r\n*Not available in all Taxis\r\n\r\n\u30fbAdvance Destination Setting\r\nYou can set the destination before your ride. This eliminates having to explain your destination to the driver, so there is no need to worry if you cannot communicate in Japanese.\r\n\r\n\u30fbConfirmation Number\r\nGive this number to the driver when your Taxi arrives, then get in. You no longer have to worry about finding your Taxi and being sure you are getting in the right one.\r\n\r\n\u30fbTipping Feature\r\nShow your appreciation to your driver by giving them a tip. You can give tips at the end of the ride from the rating screen or from \"Usage History / Receipt\" in the GO app's menu.\r\n*Tips are optional.\r\n\r\n[Notes for using GO]\r\n- If there are no available cars nearby, we may not be able to dispatch a car.\r\n- In addition to fare and pickup fee, GO App charge will apply in some areas.\r\n- Credit cards accepted: Visa / Mastercard / JCB / American Express / Diners Club\r\n- ETA is based on current conditions and this may change depending on traffic and other factors.\r\n- The request may be cancelled due to traffic or other reasons.\r\n- GPS and push notification permission must be turned on when using this service.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u30fbGO is most used Taxi App(Taxi booking app) in Japan<br>GO is the No. 1* Taxi App(cab app) serving 45 of Japan&#39;s 47 prefectures, including major tourist areas like Hokkaido, Tokyo, Kyoto, Osaka, Fukuoka and Okinawa.<br>80% of time spent on Taxi Apps in Japan is on GO.<br>You can now sign up with a non-Japanese mobile number.<br><br>* Sourced from data.ai by Sensor Tower<br>- Number of Taxi App(cab app) downloads in Japan(Total of app Store and Google Play)<br>- Survey period: October 1, 2020 - Jun 30, 2024<br>- Among the top 5 Taxi Apps in Japan, GO has an 80% market share of total usage time.\uff08Total of iOS and Android smartphone\uff09<br>- Survey period: January 1, 2021 - May 31, 2024<br>*Actual app screen may differ.<br><br>\u30fbTravel around Japan easily with GO<br>Use GO to hail the nearest Taxi(cab) to get to your destination easily. No more having to stand on the side of the road waiting for one to go by!<br>- Go easy anywhere on time<br>- Stress-free Taxi(cab) experience<br>&quot;- Best Taxi(cab) type selection<br>*Messaging and Calling features available to contact the driver directly.&quot;<br><br>\u30fbFrom hail to payment in one app by using GO<br>Do everything from hailing a Taxi(cab), to confirming your ride and paying your fare in the GO app, and go easy anywhere in Japan.<br><br>\u30fbGO PREMIUM: Request a large luxury van<br>With the GO app you can easily request a professional, highly-rated driver to pick you up in a luxury van with seating for up to six. This service is currently available in the following 15 wards of Tokyo: Chiyoda, Chuo, Minato, Shinjuku, Bunkyo, Taito, Sumida, Koto, Shinagawa, Meguro, Ota, Setagaya, Shibuya, Nakano and Toshima wards<br>*Not available in portions of Taito, Sumida, Koto, Shinagawa, Ota, Setagaya, Nakano and Toshima wards.<br>Visit the webpage below for details.<br>https://go.goinc.jp/en/premium<br><br>\u30fbReservation Service: Reserve a Taxi for a specific date and time<br>Our Reservation Service automatically hails a Taxi for you on the date and time you specify. Reservations can be made from 15 minutes to 7 days in advance.<br>A service charge will apply in addition to the Taxi fare at the time of payment.<br>*While limited to certain urban areas, new areas being added all the time.<br><br>\u30fbAirport Flat-rate<br>Get flat-rate fares from a location you specify, such as your home, hotel, a train station or travel destination to select airports. With GO there is no need to make reservations in advance: you can take advantage of this flat-rate even if you want to hail a Taxi right away.<br>Currently available for: boarding from Tokyo - Haneda/ Narita Airport (Tokyo - Narita is only transfer to the airport).<br><br>\u30fbPay your fare cashlessly with GO Pay while you ride<br>Pay for your fare automatically by adding your credit card in the app and choosing GO Pay in the Taxi. When you arrive at your destination just get out.<br>No more time wasted dealing with change or credit cards.<br>*Not available in all Taxis<br><br>\u30fbAdvance Destination Setting<br>You can set the destination before your ride. This eliminates having to explain your destination to the driver, so there is no need to worry if you cannot communicate in Japanese.<br><br>\u30fbConfirmation Number<br>Give this number to the driver when your Taxi arrives, then get in. You no longer have to worry about finding your Taxi and being sure you are getting in the right one.<br><br>\u30fbTipping Feature<br>Show your appreciation to your driver by giving them a tip. You can give tips at the end of the ride from the rating screen or from &quot;Usage History / Receipt&quot; in the GO app&#39;s menu.<br>*Tips are optional.<br><br>[Notes for using GO]<br>- If there are no available cars nearby, we may not be able to dispatch a car.<br>- In addition to fare and pickup fee, GO App charge will apply in some areas.<br>- Credit cards accepted: Visa / Mastercard / JCB / American Express / Diners Club<br>- ETA is based on current conditions and this may change depending on traffic and other factors.<br>- The request may be cancelled due to traffic or other reasons.<br>- GPS and push notification permission must be turned on when using this service.",
